Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.39,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who are in the\Nmiddle of the world. The target
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is ready for the target I\Ndon't have to wait for it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for the tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go back to the tomorrow.\NLet's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's Dark Rings\Ncouldn't completely control
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and our D3s were able to free our\Nbuddy from the Emperor's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even though that battle was\Nwon, the war was far ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we only knew\Nwho this Emperor died,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe we could guess his game plan\Nand figure out how to stop him.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx100\fscy100\pos(318,311)}The Digimon Kaiser's Loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Kaiser no Kodoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You walk much, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, team. Hustle in. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an announcement to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first scrimmage is this Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's against last year's\Nnumber one team in the league.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the team with that brainiac kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's good at soccer, sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.64,0:02:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's good at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch the name-calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Ken Ichijoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As captain of his soccer team,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken Ichijuji led his team to victory last
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,season by scoring a\Nrecord-setting 45 goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this kid may even\Nbe better than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he could be in the\NOlympics if he wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:02:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never even got a chance to beat him\Nbecause we never played his team last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys got knocked out early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't even make the playoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very funny, T .E.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't have to flat-out beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just make it a close\Ngame against a guy like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'd be a living legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and everyone knows how\Nmuch chicks dig living
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legends. Oh, Davis. No,\Nit's happening already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you see ken on the\Nsoccer field will you get his
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Autograph for me? Yo, Li and Ken\Nsitting in a tree, K-I-S-S-I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-n-g hey cody watch it besides\Ni didn't say i wanted to kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him duh i just want to marry him\Noh if you want to meet him ask
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for his autograph yourself oh i\Nguess i could do that let's all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go to the game and you can ask\Nhim then hey don't you want my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Autograph? Can I come to your game\Ntoo, Davis? Sure, you can watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me wipe the field with mr perfect\Ni'll show them who's the man
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:04:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good luck davis don't forget\Nthe hook kid give him a kiss too
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the attention while it lasts, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's really him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I woke up this morning,\NI was just a regular kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I go to bed tonight,\NI'm the king of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hope Davis hasn't\Ngotten in over his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai probably thinks I've gotten in\Nover my head, but I'll show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Ken? Where is he? Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're waiting for Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, we know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken's not coming, is he, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you stop asking me if I say yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, for me, I have no spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, uh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any of you know when that\NKen kid's gonna be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's got a soft drink\Ncommercial to shoot and a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meeting about having a\Nsoccer ball named after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken hardly has time to\Nplay soccer anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never get to play him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, David, can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if Ken doesn't show, his\Nteammates are still champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:05:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not careful, they'll\Nuse you as the soccer ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you gotta know if you play really\Nwell against last year's champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Win or lose, you'll still be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll still be a living legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to stay\Nhere if Ken isn't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I don't have important\Nthings I could be doing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta play as well as Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TOGETHER
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it up. Cause they ain't seen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last of me and you,\Nlet's keep your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TOGETHER
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TOGETHER. It's rewinding. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look good on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I so kick butt out there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you kicked the ball really good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.08,0:06:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You nailed that shot, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys only lead by one goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The game's still wide open\Nand Ken could still show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what's Ken going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, if he was here\Nright now, I'd show him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and my big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Ken! I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody pinch me! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's looking right at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm going to faint!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what all the fuss is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he doesn't look so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all the attention he's getting, that\Nguy sure knows how to keep his cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like lukewarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so funny I forgot to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken, we're really glad\Nyou could make it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.24,0:06:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm a little late, Coach,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there was something\Nimportant that I had to do first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just happy you found\Nthe time for us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I put you in the game now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now substituting number seven,\NKen the Rocket, Itchy Joji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be Ken. I'm Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looked right at me, poor Oman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe he's even cuter\Nin person than he is on TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could just hug him all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not an accordion, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a kid like you, Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta outrun him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if you can't, we won't\Nthink any less of you, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some nice friends you got there, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you catch that move?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw him first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goal scored by the Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Houston, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so amazing, and did I mention Dreamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like for me\Nto pinch you up, Dan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, Ichijouji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken and Yoli, Ichijouji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that Ken's tied up the game, I wonder\Nhow it's gonna affect Davis' confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis isn't looking too good out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ben's running circles around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Davis isn't even there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy as shooting goals into an empty net.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenny has more than just skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He leads his team like\Na general leads an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not just good, he's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick to the playbook I wrote, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have got him on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All fullbacks and midfielders, move up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You run around, I run around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.32,0:08:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna run, run, run around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, the rocket's gone! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice tackle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good trip, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you next fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's run out, and\Nthe Green Tamachi team,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Led by Ken the Rocket Ichijouji, wins 9-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken, is your leg all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that tackle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I caught you off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I barely felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too busy thinking about scoring goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess you heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your teammates probably told you\Nabout how I was dominating the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how unstoppable I was before you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone may have mentioned\Nsomething about your play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep it up, you\Nmight win a championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, once you came along and\Nyou guys got so far ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just figured it was all or nothing,\Nso I just went for it on that last play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was obviously focused on scoring\Nanother goal and didn't see you coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That play never fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it did against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my worthy adversary, farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until we meet again in battle. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worthy adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we shook hands and\Nhe said he admired me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen you this\Nhappy about losing a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And guess what he called me\Nhis worthy adversary I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rocket practically said\NI'm just as good as he is I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't believe you didn't\Nget me his autograph made a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pinch, that sliding block you did\Nwas ultra cool, Davis. Yeah, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made my toes tingle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I predict
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you that Ken and I are gonna be\Non the same championship team someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Think you're getting ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you ought to try\Nsomething first How about
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you try scoring at least\None goal against him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very funny, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess you got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, laugh when you are still able.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the time draws closer to\Nwhen you shall bow before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one is my equal, as\Nyou shall find out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.23,0:10:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you shook hands with\NKen, if I shake hands with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.44,0:11:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be almost like I'm\Nshaking hands with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait to shake hands\Nwith my beloved in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what are you doing, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.24,0:11:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me pinch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Controlling, spying, the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been built overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.59,0:11:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just where is it located?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This map doesn't list\Nthe points of interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the forbidden valley of no return.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do bad guys always\Nname things like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in the job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.24,0:11:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right after really stinky breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if this place was\Ncalled the Valley of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tags and Bunnies with\Nthe control spire there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to destroy it before it's\Nused to control all the Digimon, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiport open!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this valley sure\Nlooks forbidden, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few Tags and bunnies would spruce it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, quit kidding around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor could be around\Nhere anywhere, so stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this valley is\Nkind of quaint and homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like homely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want the Emperor\Nto hear us coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gosh, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, did you see that, Beemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground just ate our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'll swallow us next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you better call\NTai to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, V-Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll take way too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me dig before we find more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More trouble is found, V-Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Emperor, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends, as you call\Nthem, are here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.12,0:13:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and see for yourself if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, V-Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground could open up\Nand swallow us any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to start getting more exercise,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but running for my life\Nwasn't what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm more worried about\Nour friends right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's voice came\Nfrom this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I am so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let my friends go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends are at my mercy,\Nand so it would appear are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,David, save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, you can still escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take your eyes off the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll think of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time is running short.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoops, time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awaken, Deltamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a duck here or a bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what is that thing, B-mon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deltamon is a dragon-type\NDigimon with a metal
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,head for one hand and\Na skull for the other!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a captured triplex\Nfortune serpent bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What luck that you all drop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, it's still tomorrow's dinner time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I think eating all of you\Nwill make a well-balanced meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears that you have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want me to show\Nmercy, you must beg for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me, pathetic loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your knees and beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Master, spare my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't davish please master spare my friends\Nplease master spare my worthless friends
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please master spare my\Nworthless friends that's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excellent now vehement\Nrestrain him i command you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never it's okay do what\Nhe says davish do it for
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the others if it'll save\Nour friends obey the emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing you squirm is so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are so entertaining, maybe\NI should take pity on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, Deltamon has only three\Nmouths, but there are four children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you may have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.74,0:15:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sadly, I cannot spare them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choose who will be spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I have to choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I pick one over the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be done delicately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have until the sands run out\Nto choose, and it isn't long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty boy it isn't long don't\Nworry about me save one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,others get out of here davis\Ngo ahead save yourself oh sure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make me look bad fine then don't\Nsave me whatever you decide
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do davis we trust you so\Nthink of something i uh i just
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't know what i should do\Nthe sands running out how am i
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supposed to choose only one of\Nmy friends and sacrifice all
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest, like sands in the\Nhourglass, so are your friends' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i just i i can't do it\Nwill you throw all their
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lives away is that what\Nyou call friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're all my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kari tk cody yo lee
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brought this on yourself. You made\Nme look like a fool. Now you must suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now Digidestined time's\Nup it's time to say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait take me instead of\Nthe others hmm you think
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can satisfy his hunger\Nall right then Deltamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out, Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, if you've been holding back\Nand planning a surprise attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now it'd be a good time to help surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:16:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't even my birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holsmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an illusion! We're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you're here, who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew, gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite their obvious\Ndental hygiene problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon are able to accurately\Nimpersonate any other creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their attack is called the Dark Claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made the Bakemon look like our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumped Bakemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.26,0:17:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had that kid right where I wanted him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you\Npulled that trick on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, V-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neemon! Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, the fire of courage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon, you gap-toothed fools, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not me, them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come, they're everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like mosquitoes, attack them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never saw mosquitoes do that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's controlling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Rings of the Bakemon\Nare wearing out of the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's ordering them around like\Na general leading his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on. Finish them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:18:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help them now. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay and guard the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tried to take over the\Ndigital world and destroy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm taking you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot lose to a child like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a kid just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deltamon, triplex, force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blamed you mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why leave so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The party's just starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klaestamon, aim for the Dark Reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor's power of\Nthe Bakemon is weakening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now or never. This\Nis our chance to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Target the Control Spire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta, go? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure did! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.35,0:20:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What went wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My master plan was invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see I've neglected to factor in that\Nyou're one of those all-or-nothing types.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the same person made me\Nlook like a fool twice in the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.98,0:20:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how'd you get that cut on your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could, and I am Ken Ichijoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken is the DG1 Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Davis, farewell for now, my worthy\Nadversary, until we meet again in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really looked up to you, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dreamed of being just like you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I know you're my sworn enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can say is, and I mean this,\Nyou can keep your crummy autograph!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.62,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.62,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.79,0:22:41.59,Ken's note,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318,234)}I have nothing to do with this world anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.79,0:22:41.59,Ken's note,,0,0,0,,{\pos(301,289)}Farewell, insects.
